  "instance_name": "liberal_privilege_mapping",
  "label": "Jussie Smollett is mapped as the beneficiary of 'liberal privilege'",
  "description": "The text 'my liberal privilege liberal privilege kept me out of prison' explicitly attributes the concept of 'liberal privilege' to the person in the image (Jussie Smollett). The visual material (Jussie_Smollett) is mapped onto the textual concept 'liberal privilege' as the entity that possesses or benefits from it. This mapping is central to the meme's harmful intent, as it frames the subject's identity (Black, liberal) as the source of legal impunity, which is a false equivalence and a harmful stereotype.",
